    "description": "S14 empty state — a shared business whose Partner Current A/cs have not been seeded yet (02 §7.1). No call to action: seeding happens with the owners step of S0.6/S8.1, which this screen does not own, and 07 §1 rule 6 forbids a door that leads nowhere."
