    "description": "S14 when the book turns out to have a single owner. ADR 2026-09-09b 🔒: a *Just me* business never mentions partners, ratios or profit distribution anywhere in the app — so this state says none of those words. It exists only because a stale link or an ownership change can land on the route; the shell never offers it (07 §1 rule 6 still wants a way back, which the app bar gives)."
